      "json_path": [
        "6000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f87f95c50b22328b15c3da39",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "仍然寒冷的%course，等待着挑战者\\n大雪中的%race\\n%ground%distance\\n究竟哪位赛马娘能够抵达胜利！",
