      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e75524d30ea80ad5c3907fd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "美丽的青空之下，%course\\n的草地形成了绝佳的良马场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ff49eac8f45c4cf9a509e5671fde0265d21705a83f22fc3ded194880018c3b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae28d630f32085c19b6f7213",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "时常有雨落下，%course\\n天气反复无常，\\n马场的状态为稍重",
      "source_fingerprint": "26bda1dd90c3fcab252fc856697d5fa67ae1aaa94d9a63a9bb35869f999001ad",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c2eecd5e2c1f4da6fbfcac",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "很不凑巧雨水打湿了草皮，%course\\n马场的状态是重",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4df453f6893e25dc9430f4058f543828ea20c09381f7e8b35e904e38912c3a",
